# Gate G-M7's G-R8 baseline for the media crate (scripts/gates/media-vendored-clock-log.sh =
# dm-vendored-clock-log.sh --graph media; Phase 11 design faza11-media.md §13.1, §16.1 G-M7; slice S1).
# The compiled library code of every crate of `cargo tree -p ghost-client-media -e normal` on
# aarch64-linux-android and x86_64-linux-android, with the features each has in that graph (slice S2
# switches to the features of the shipped ghost-client-net when ghost-client-dm links the crate),
# merged over both triples. Kinds: [lib] linked into the library; [proc-macro] and [build-time] run
# only while compiling. Every site, directive and note line ends in its reason after two spaces and
# '#'. An entry the scan finds and this file lacks fails the gate (unjustified); an entry here the scan
# no longer finds fails it too (stale). Regenerate at a pin change with GHOST_G_R8_PRINT=1 and
# complete every '# UNJUSTIFIED' by review, never by copy.
#
# Seeded 2026-10-04 by slice S1: 28 crates (ghost-client-media and the AEAD, HKDF, SHA-2 and zeroize
# stack ghost-client-dm already ships), 1 site and 44 directives, every one of them the same entry,
# with the same reason, as in dm-vendored-clock-log.baseline (the crates are the DM graph's, at the
# same versions). ghost-client-media itself: no site.
crate aead@0.6.1 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate block-buffer@0.12.1 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate cfg-if@1.0.4 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate chacha20@0.10.2 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate chacha20poly1305@0.11.0 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate cipher@0.5.2 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate cmov@0.5.4 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate const-oid@0.10.2 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate cpufeatures@0.3.1 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate crypto-common@0.2.2 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate ctutils@0.4.2 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate digest@0.11.3 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate ghost-client-media@0.1.0 lib LicenseRef-GHOST-Proprietary
crate hkdf@0.13.0 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate hmac@0.13.0 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate hybrid-array@0.4.15 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate inout@0.2.2 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate libc@0.2.189 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate poly1305@0.9.1 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate proc-macro2@1.0.107 build-time MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate quote@1.0.47 build-time MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate sha2@0.11.0 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate syn@2.0.119 build-time MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate typenum@1.20.1 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate unicode-ident@1.0.24 build-time (MIT OR Apache-2.0) AND Unicode-3.0
crate universal-hash@0.6.1 lib MIT OR Apache-2.0
crate zeroize@1.9.0 lib Apache-2.0 OR MIT
crate zeroize_derive@1.5.0 proc-macro Apache-2.0 OR MIT
